<title>CHINA: HAECO sees full year net in line with 96.</title>
<headline>HAECO sees full year net in line with 96.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Aircraft Engineering Co Ltd (HAECO) said on Tuesday it expected its full year profit to be broadly in line with that of 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The balance of the year will remain challenging, but I expect that the profit attributable to shareholders before exceptional items for the full year will be broadly in line with that for 1996,&quot; HAECO's chairman David Turnbull said in a statement.</p>
<p>HAECO posted a slight rise in profit for the six months to June 30 to HK$179. million 6 ($23 million) from HK$178.8 million in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>It reported a net profit of HK$494.5 million in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
<p>($ = 7.741 Hong Kong Dollars)</p>
</text>
